        "title": "The diagram below shows how instant noodles are manufactured. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The diagram below shows how instant noodles are manufactured. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - How instant noodles are manufactured</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZE0EderokonhrdxOGQOlbqckg8g\">Đề b&agrave;i How instant noodles are manufactured y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất m&igrave; ăn liền.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-K5pSdLrQpoF8acxi6Wrln1gigeg\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề How instant noodles are manufactured với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh sản xuất m&igrave; ăn liền - từ nguy&ecirc;n liệu bột m&igrave; đến sản phẩm m&igrave; ăn liền ho&agrave;n chỉnh.</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JEbsd2QXSos0HUxGNcHlF0ntgab\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HVebdDKPDoNbSExDutel4LdQgeo\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BVeFdLujWon2cIxTpmRl2ZVLgsd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề process, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh đưa ra c&aacute;i nh&igrave;n tổng quan về c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WC1CdzFMdosCLcxEsW2l4ctEgjb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Quy tr&igrave;nh n&agrave;y bao gồm nhiều bước.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V2VPdMAvPoFqkkxqptzlZnh8gMb\" data-list=\"bullet\">Bắt đầu bằng việc <strong>nguy&ecirc;n liệu th&ocirc; được lưu trữ trong kho chứa</strong> (<em>raw materials stored in silos</em>) v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c khi <strong>c&aacute;c cốc m&igrave; được d&aacute;n nh&atilde;n v&agrave; ni&ecirc;m phong sẵn s&agrave;ng ph&acirc;n phối</strong> (<em>labeled and sealed noodle cups ready for distribution</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0uhdsgGwoKI77xgKkZlSFkigwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WLkcdtYmdoCbPRx82yGlwGHNgjc\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch<strong> chia c&aacute;c bước trong quy tr&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh 2 phần</strong>:</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LqvhdFeMUoZxZrxNwSilgmVJgBN\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P06AdwVAioetUFx6MzilxCvvgvf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yu4MdOZ1JoLYsQxGQNRlpNuOgsb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MfFWd7rzNoOfyax6As5l5WbjgPb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DA9Wd4PctodTUwxgjellSqICgId\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> C&aacute;c bước sơ chế v&agrave; tạo h&igrave;nh (4 bước đầu)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ToXUd7OVloDhT2xGN2TlViYmgWf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Ban đầu, bột m&igrave; được <strong>vận chuyển từ kho chứa</strong> (<em>delivered from storage silos</em>) đến <strong>m&aacute;y trộn</strong> (<em>mixer</em>), nơi được <strong>kết hợp với nước v&agrave; dầu</strong> (<em>combined with water and oil</em>) để tạo th&agrave;nh <strong>bột nhồi</strong> (<em>dough</em>)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">Hỗn hợp n&agrave;y sau đ&oacute; được <strong>xử l&yacute; qua con lăn</strong> (<em>processed through rollers</em>) để tạo th&agrave;nh <strong>c&aacute;c tấm bột phẳng</strong> (<em>flat dough sheets</em>), sau đ&oacute; được <strong>cắt th&agrave;nh c&aacute;c dải bột mỏng</strong> (<em>cut into thin dough strips</em>)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\">C&aacute;c dải n&agrave;y được <strong>tạo h&igrave;nh th&agrave;nh c&aacute;c đĩa m&igrave; tr&ograve;n</strong> (<em>shaped into round noodle discs</em>) trước khi được <strong>nấu trong dầu v&agrave; sấy kh&ocirc;</strong> (<em>cooked in oil and dried</em>) để <strong>loại bỏ độ ẩm</strong> (<em>remove moisture</em>), đảm bảo <strong>thời hạn sử dụng l&acirc;u d&agrave;i</strong> (<em>long shelf life</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HKUodfK9xogC0MxTp2Wlp70ng9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QcskdIE6RoFckExwCkClFQLsglf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UcPzdqFBqofBD1xRL88lNtv5gP1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXVUdjVVKo0SA1xuZW1l8Varggb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: C&aacute;c bước ho&agrave;n thiện v&agrave; đ&oacute;ng g&oacute;i (4 bước cuối)</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>M&igrave; kh&ocirc; được đặt v&agrave;o cốc</strong> (<em>dried noodles are placed into cups</em>), v&agrave; <strong>rau củ v&agrave; gia vị được th&ecirc;m v&agrave;o</strong> (<em>vegetables and spices are added</em>) để <strong>ho&agrave;n thiện c&aacute;c th&agrave;nh phần của bữa ăn</strong> (<em>complete the meal components</em>)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c cốc sau đ&oacute; <strong>tiến đến trạm d&aacute;n nh&atilde;n v&agrave; ni&ecirc;m phong</strong> (<em>proceed to the labelling and sealing station</em>), nơi ch&uacute;ng <strong>nhận nh&atilde;n th&ocirc;ng tin sản phẩm</strong> (<em>receive product information labels</em>) v&agrave; được <strong>ni&ecirc;m phong k&iacute;n</strong> (<em>hermetically sealed</em>) để <strong>duy tr&igrave; độ tươi</strong> (<em>maintain freshness</em>)</li>\n<li class=\"whitespace-normal break-words\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Cuối c&ugrave;ng, <strong>c&aacute;c cốc đ&atilde; ni&ecirc;m phong được chuyển đến băng chuyền</strong> (<em>sealed cups are transferred to conveyor belts</em>) nơi ch&uacute;ng được <strong>thu thập để lưu kho v&agrave; vận chuyển</strong> (<em>collected for storage and shipment</em>)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2092,
            "sort": 1,
